  - `sourceVmid Int`, `targetVmid Int`: a new fleet-unique id, never recycled
  - `status VmMoveStatus @default(PLANNED)`, `phase String @default("PREFLIGHT")`
  - `dryRun Boolean @default(false)`, `reason String?`, `requestedById String?`
